Subject: [PATCH 1339/3799] soh: rename func_80BA2304 ->
 ObjWarp2block_RunOcarinaCheck

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: calls whichever ocarina sub-state is installed, then records the last played song for the next frame's comparison.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c  | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Warp2block/z_obj_warp2block.c
